atus":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Modern Casino Tycoon Simulation in full 3D glory. Build the casino. Set the odds. Expand into a luxury hotel/casino or go cheap & extract max profits. Keep the vault secure at all times, and beware of criminals & cheaters!!","detailedDescription":"Get Involved!\n\n Chat directly with the developers and community!\nVisit our workshop! Make your own slot games, tv stations, walls, floors, and more!\n\nPlease Check Out Our Upcoming Game!\n\nAbout the Game\n\nThe Full Casino and Resort Tycoon Experience\n\n3D graphics. Deep systems. Massive customization and creativity. Extensive mods. AND full soundtrack, from world-renowned composer Jerry Martin!\nYou are the Casino. Does the House Always Win?\n\nYou set the odds! Thieves, cheaters, and criminals can tilt the odds against you! Deter them with cameras and interrogation rooms! If you want to manage every last chip in the casino's vault, micro-manage the games & odds on slot machines, keep tabs on every deck of cards, or even design the ultimate high-efficiency staff schedule & security patrol scheme -- you can do all of that, and a lot more!\nWorkshop Support\n\nEverything from custom pictures, floors, walls, slot machine games, TV videos, and even code! Share your casinos and mods on the workshop!\nGet Creative - Customize & Design Every Aspect\n\nThis isn't a one size fits all kind of game. Build luxury hotels or cheap no-frills casinos. Choose every finish, from the walls & flooring styles, the lighting, the counter-top & bar-top materials, even the restroom stalls. After building your huge resort, walk around it with our first person mode!\nHuge Number of Building Options!\n\n- Slot Machines - Table Games - Sports Betting - Jackpot Displays \n- Bingo - Theatres - Dressing Rooms - Dance Floors - Gyms \n- Single & Multi-Guest Bedrooms - Luxury Rooms with Wet Bars & Hot Tubs \n- Buffets - Bars - Vending Machines - Lounges \n- Plants - Signs - Wall Decor - Lights & Neons - Themed Decor \n- Computer Rooms - Meeting Rooms - Conference Halls \n- ATMs & Cashier Cages - Security Cameras - Interrogation Rooms","aboutGame":"The Full Casino and Resort Tycoon Experience\n\n3D graphics. Deep systems. Massive customization and creativity. Extensive mods. AND full soundtrack, from world-renowned composer Jerry Martin!\nYou are the Casino. Does the House Always Win?\n\nYou set the odds! Thieves, cheaters, and criminals can tilt the odds against you! Deter them with cameras and interrogation rooms! If you want to manage every last chip in the casino's vault, micro-manage the games & odds on slot machines, keep tabs on every deck of cards, or even design the ultimate high-efficiency staff schedule & security patrol scheme -- you can do all of that, and a lot more!\nWorkshop Support\n\nEverything from custom pictures, floors, walls, slot machine games, TV videos, and even code! Share your casinos and mods on the workshop!\nGet Creative - Customize & Design Every Aspect\n\nThis isn't a one size fits all kind of game. Build luxury hotels or cheap no-frills casinos. Choose every finish, from the walls & flooring styles, the lighting, the counter-top & bar-top materials, even the restroom stalls. After building your huge resort, walk around it with our first person mode!\nHuge Number of Building Options!\n\n- Slot Machines - Table Games - Sports Betting - Jackpot Displays \n- Bingo - Theatres - Dressing Rooms - Dance Floors - Gyms \n- Single & Multi-Guest Bedrooms - Luxury Rooms with Wet Bars & Hot Tubs \n- Buffets - Bars - Vending Machines - Lounges \n- Plants - Signs - Wall Decor - Lights & Neons - Themed Decor \n- Computer Rooms - Meeting Rooms - Conference Halls \n- ATMs & Cashier Cages - Security Cameras - Interrogation Rooms"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass